Name Banjo Memorial #1

Interactability_Text_Line_0 Banjo you were the greatest friend, family member, and pet I could ever ask for.
Interactability_Text_Line_1 You were always there for me, and I wish I could've be there for you when you passed away.
Interactability_Text_Line_2 I would give anything to be with you and to feel you purr one more time.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 From your loving owner - Nolan